of the sections, participants were asked to which time window the following questions refer, with the options “Genau jetzt, in diesem Moment”, “In der letzten Woche”, “Im letzten Monat”, “Im letzten Jahr” and “Seit der Geburt”. For the State-Trait Inventory for Cognitive and Somatic Anxiety (STICSA), the trait items ask how the participant feels in general and the state items how the participant feels right now; the Obsessive-Compulsive Inventory-Revised (OCI) and the PTSD Checklist for DSM-5 (PCL-5) refer to the last month; the BDI-II refers to the last two weeks including the day of completion; the Intolerance of Uncertainty Scale (IU) has no time window and describes the person in general. Because the options contain neither “in general” nor “two weeks”, the answers counted as matching are “Seit der Geburt” for the STICSA trait and IU sections, “In der letzten Woche” for the BDI-II, and the literal time window for the other sections.","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"uiGR5ln4Pf"}],"key":"S30IIS9ocW"},{"type":"table","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableRow","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Section","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"xlw33EDVh8"}],"key":"ckGd29ahAp"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Matching answer","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"epd1q2dLsU"}],"key":"SGJm9qfgjy"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Matching","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"l